  const out=await ai.generate({system:'Write concise plain-text B2B supplier partnership outreach. Be truthful and specific. Personalize naturally using the company and area supplied. Never claim existing volume, guaranteed jobs, exclusivity, prior relationship, scarcity, negotiated pricing, or that they were specially selected unless supported. Frame the value as potential paid fulfillment work, not lead sales. Touch 1 should be about 70-110 words; follow-ups 35-70 words. The only primary CTA is: reply YES. Do not ask for a full rate card in the first email. If they reply YES, the next qualification step will request 10/15/20-yard net rates, included days/tonnage, overage fees and service area. Include a plain opt-out sentence. No hype, fake urgency, tracking language or attachments.',prompt:`Company: ${p.company}. Area: ${p.town}. Touch ${touch} of 3. Objective: ${objective}`,thinkingMode:'FAST',maxTokens:220,temperature:.2});
